_:genid979 <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "DE: Der Abstand des Referenzpunkts der rechten Kappe von der Brückenachse berechnet sich aus CAP99XXq00=PAV00XXq00-CAP99XXb04-PAV00XXb01, wobei PAV der angrenzende Fahrbahnbelag ist.; EN: The distance between the reference point of the right cap and the bridge axis is calculated as follows CAP99XXq00=PAV00XXq00-CAP99XXb04-PAV00XXb01, where PAV represents the adjacent pavement." .
